#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/arch-handbook/boot/_index.adoc:1220
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Kernel Initialization"
msgstr "内核初始化"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/arch-handbook/boot/_index.adoc:1227
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Let us take a look at the command that links the kernel.  This will help "
