"now excluded from [.filename]#sys/conf/Makefile.i386#.  The content that "
"interests us can be found in [.filename]#/usr/obj/usr/src/i386.i386/sys/"
"GENERIC/#."
msgstr "让我们看看链接内核的命令。这有助于确定 loader 将执行权交给内核的确切位置，也就是内核的实际入口点。此命令现在已从 [.filename]#sys/conf/Makefile.i386# 中移除。我们关注的内容可以在 [.filename]#/usr/obj/usr/src/i386.i386/sys/GENERIC/# 中找到。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
