#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/arch-handbook/boot/_index.adoc:1264
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"First, the register EFLAGS is set to a predefined value of 0x00000002.  Then "
"all the segment registers are initialized:"
