msgstr "接下来的三行代码是因为分页已启用，所以需要跳转以便在虚拟化地址空间中继续执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/arch-handbook/boot/_index.adoc:1328
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
