#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/arch-handbook/boot/_index.adoc:1375
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`init_param1()` is defined in [.filename]#sys/kern/subr_param.c#.  That file "
"has a number of sysctls, and two functions, `init_param1()` and "
